4. AI AND MACHINE LEARNING DISCLAIMER

The Software produces routing recommendations, risk scores, and cost estimates
generated in part by a machine learning model and in part by business-rule
engines.

THESE OUTPUTS ARE RECOMMENDATIONS, NOT DETERMINATIONS. The licensee remains
solely responsible for all return-handling decisions. The licensee must maintain
human review for high-value returns and for any case in which a recommendation
would result in the denial of a customer claim.

The distinction between machine-learned and rule-based components is documented
in docs/ai/AI_TRANSPARENCY.md and docs/ai/MODEL_CARD.md. Reported model metrics
are described in those documents as unverified and must not be relied upon as
performance guarantees.

